\">58-df-zfc-model7-premouse</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"812378a7c13a40e3\" href=\"?note=812378a7c13a40e3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse\">58-df-zfc-inner4-active-premouse</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4PassivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4PassivePremouse}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}passive\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4PassivePremouse}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}passive\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInner4PassivePremouse}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ActivePremouse}_S(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Passivity is the complement of the canonical active-premouse predicate inside the class of premice; the undeclared projection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^M\">\\(F^M\\)</span> is no longer used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse","status":"resolv